(1231616, 155503, 32239, '<td valign="top">Now if this isn''t too cute, I don''t know what is! :)<br/> <br/>The only thing is the dogs almost mesh with the black leather couch! lol The lighting off them and the couch is almost identical, so it kind of blurs the subjects in a tad too much with their surroundings.</td>', 'Now if this isn''t too cute, I don''t know what is! :) The only thing is the dogs almost mesh with the black leather couch! lol The lighting off them and the couch is almost identical, so it kind of blurs the subjects in a tad too much with their surroundings.', '2005-03-16 08:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
