(1231620, 156396, 32239, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition and lighting! I really like this shot! The similar eye expressions is awesome!<br/> <br/>But..... I don''t see "best friends" in this.  I hardly believe that that inanimate object is this lovely dogs best friend.</td>', 'Fabulous composition and lighting! I really like this shot! The similar eye expressions is awesome! But..... I don''t see "best friends" in this.  I hardly believe that that inanimate object is this lovely dogs best friend.', '2005-03-16 08:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
