(1231633, 156418, 32239, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, lighting and clarity of this pic.<br/> <br/>I think it would look more real if the writing wasn''t printed out though.  You can tell it is.  Perfect alignement and measurement of letters ect. I think maybe writing half the "letter" with a caliography (sp?) pen, with the tip just away from the last word written. <br/> <br/>Still nice shot though. I gave you a 7 :)</td>', 'Love the composition, lighting and clarity of this pic. I think it would look more real if the writing wasn''t printed out though.  You can tell it is.  Perfect alignement and measurement of letters ect. I think maybe writing half the "letter" with a caliography (sp?) pen, with the tip just away from the last word written.  Still nice shot though. I gave you a 7 :)', '2005-03-16 09:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1231635, 156577, 32239, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and composition.  I''d like to see a little more sharpness though.</td>', 'Nice concept and composition.  I''d like to see a little more sharpness though.', '2005-03-16 09:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
