(1231989, 156426, 12750, '<td valign="top">Clever! And I like the framing. Seems too bright though, maybe overexposed.  Maybe could be resolved using a whitebackground with less exposure instead?<br/></td>', 'Clever! And I like the framing. Seems too bright though, maybe overexposed.  Maybe could be resolved using a whitebackground with less exposure instead?', '2005-03-16 11:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1231990, 154646, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good and the close-up composition is also good. I''m torn between liking and disliking the color cast. On one hand it is soft and romantic and on the other it''s a little too peach. The artist certainly did a good job of rendering emotion with this piece. I like it, but you''ll likely find a few people who dont like photographs of art.</td>', 'The lighting is good and the close-up composition is also good. I''m torn between liking and disliking the color cast. On one hand it is soft and romantic and on the other it''s a little too peach. The artist certainly did a good job of rendering emotion with this piece. I like it, but you''ll likely find a few people who dont like photographs of art.', '2005-03-16 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1231991, 156416, 12750, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for sepia pictures.  The ceiling is throwing me off in this like she has to duck to fit in there, but otherwise well executed.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for sepia pictures.  The ceiling is throwing me off in this like she has to duck to fit in there, but otherwise well executed.', '2005-03-16 11:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
