(1231997, 156187, 32265, '<td valign="top">nice image. i like the choice of lens, and the dog''s attention is really there. two thing i think would have made it a better photo<br/> <br/>1- move the rug out of the shot<br/>2- block the sunlight from hitting the floor behind them</td>', 'nice image. i like the choice of lens, and the dog''s attention is really there. two thing i think would have made it a better photo 1- move the rug out of the shot2- block the sunlight from hitting the floor behind them', '2005-03-16 11:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1231999, 154811, 6008, '<td valign="top">Seems a little oversaturated, especially on the reds. Crouching down and shooting up may have given it a little more bond between the two and also the slightly different angle could possibly add some interest. Additionally it may have helped remove the white band on the top of his head, which stands out a little too much.</td>', 'Seems a little oversaturated, especially on the reds. Crouching down and shooting up may have given it a little more bond between the two and also the slightly different angle could possibly add some interest. Additionally it may have helped remove the white band on the top of his head, which stands out a little too much.', '2005-03-16 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232001, 156093, 12750, '<td valign="top">With some cleanup and color adjustments this could make it pretty far. As it stands though it seems to lack a clean focal point with the black noisy water on the bottom since it seems black is the background you were shooting for, and the white balance might be able to be adjusted for adjustment on the feathers?</td>', 'With some cleanup and color adjustments this could make it pretty far. As it stands though it seems to lack a clean focal point with the black noisy water on the bottom since it seems black is the background you were shooting for, and the white balance might be able to be adjusted for adjustment on the feathers?', '2005-03-16 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232004, 154422, 12750, '<td valign="top">The noise/dirt on the black distracts me away from the combo of the two.  I think this would do better with a very clean background. But careful not to upset the anti-neatimage voters. ;-)  Personal preference with this shot.</td>', 'The noise/dirt on the black distracts me away from the combo of the two.  I think this would do better with a very clean background. But careful not to upset the anti-neatimage voters. ;-)  Personal preference with this shot.', '2005-03-16 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232005, 156355, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice setting and humurous picture. I just wish father and son were better placed in the photo. Great colors, brightness and contrast.</td>', 'Very nice setting and humurous picture. I just wish father and son were better placed in the photo. Great colors, brightness and contrast.', '2005-03-16 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
