(1232016, 154582, 31211, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great candid photo, if the children were closer and better focused and iluminated. Like the sepia look. Good luck.</td>', 'This could have been a great candid photo, if the children were closer and better focused and iluminated. Like the sepia look. Good luck.', '2005-03-16 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
