(1232022, 156333, 31211, '<td valign="top">Great cat shot - and beautiful cats... Tried to do the same with mine, but they aren''t as photogenic as yours (or I''m not as gifted as you are). Like the sepia tone - it works very well.</td>', 'Great cat shot - and beautiful cats... Tried to do the same with mine, but they aren''t as photogenic as yours (or I''m not as gifted as you are). Like the sepia tone - it works very well.', '2005-03-16 11:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232023, 156535, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, seems to be pushing it in regards to the challenge topic. Can a food source be a best friend? I''m sure some psychoanalyts or chocolate addicts say so. Completely disregarding the challenge it''s not a bad shot. The mix of sharpness and motion blur on the bee is good. It''s a very colorful image. The out of focus grass or plant stems on the bottom left is a little bit of a distraction. It''s not a perfect shot but certainly marketable.</td>', 'Hrm, seems to be pushing it in regards to the challenge topic. Can a food source be a best friend? I''m sure some psychoanalyts or chocolate addicts say so. Completely disregarding the challenge it''s not a bad shot. The mix of sharpness and motion blur on the bee is good. It''s a very colorful image. The out of focus grass or plant stems on the bottom left is a little bit of a distraction. It''s not a perfect shot but certainly marketable.', '2005-03-16 11:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232025, 156355, 32239, '<td valign="top">Hey! It''s Big Daddy! LOL <br/> <br/>Nice composition, great light and concept.</td>', 'Hey! It''s Big Daddy! LOL  Nice composition, great light and concept.', '2005-03-16 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232028, 154958, 31211, '<td valign="top">Nice candid moment. I just wish I could see more of the surroundings and that the colors were a bit warmer. Nice shot, though.</td>', 'Nice candid moment. I just wish I could see more of the surroundings and that the colors were a bit warmer. Nice shot, though.', '2005-03-16 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232031, 156417, 31211, '<td valign="top">Like this picture very much, it has almost a photojournalistic feel. Congratulations.</td>', 'Like this picture very much, it has almost a photojournalistic feel. Congratulations.', '2005-03-16 11:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232032, 155431, 15632, '<td valign="top">Impressive idea!</td>', 'Impressive idea!', '2005-03-16 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232033, 156465, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostition. I just wish the foreground were a little more out of focus, so you could focus on father and son.</td>', 'Very nice compostition. I just wish the foreground were a little more out of focus, so you could focus on father and son.', '2005-03-16 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232034, 155641, 6008, '<td valign="top">It conveys best friends but mostly it comes across as a snapshot. There is a lot of clutter, which could be argued as a realistic condition given the situation but that doesnt really give it much artistic value or interest to an outside viewer.</td>', 'It conveys best friends but mostly it comes across as a snapshot. There is a lot of clutter, which could be argued as a realistic condition given the situation but that doesnt really give it much artistic value or interest to an outside viewer.', '2005-03-16 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232037, 155503, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition seems a little haphazard and although I can make out it is two dogs snuggling the image is a little dark and the bodies and couch are somewhat merged together. The roundish light object on the right is also stealing the eye''s attention as it is one of the lightest objects in the image.</td>', 'The composition seems a little haphazard and although I can make out it is two dogs snuggling the image is a little dark and the bodies and couch are somewhat merged together. The roundish light object on the right is also stealing the eye''s attention as it is one of the lightest objects in the image.', '2005-03-16 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232040, 155624, 31211, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot. The b&amp;w really works here and you''ve captured the children at the perfect moment. However, I think the photo lacks in pixel quality or is oversharpened or something like that.</td>', 'Great candid shot. The b&w really works here and you''ve captured the children at the perfect moment. However, I think the photo lacks in pixel quality or is oversharpened or something like that.', '2005-03-16 12:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232045, 156584, 30173, '<td valign="top">That''s so brutal....</td>', 'That''s so brutal....', '2005-03-16 12:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232049, 154811, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice and candid moment. But I think the colors are a bit oversaturated and the image is oversharpened or so - what I''m trying to say is it isnt clear, in terms of image quality.</td>', 'Very nice and candid moment. But I think the colors are a bit oversaturated and the image is oversharpened or so - what I''m trying to say is it isnt clear, in terms of image quality.', '2005-03-16 12:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232051, 156528, 6008, '<td valign="top">The near/far perspective shot is good and so is the idea. The low light seems to have caused noise on the face and it is also rather red. Having a secondary light on the face may have helped, as well as using color balance in post processing to lessen the red.</td>', 'The near/far perspective shot is good and so is the idea. The low light seems to have caused noise on the face and it is also rather red. Having a secondary light on the face may have helped, as well as using color balance in post processing to lessen the red.', '2005-03-16 12:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232053, 156469, 31211, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture the friendship in this humoristic shot. Congratulations</td>', 'You managed to capture the friendship in this humoristic shot. Congratulations', '2005-03-16 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232059, 155592, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I noticed was the crooked horizon. It would have been better to crop out that completely. Additionally the girls'' legs are cropped out, which seems odd considering there is a lot of negative space around them. Crouching down to that you were on their level and getting either a closer up view of the girls or else getting in their entire bodies would have helped.</td>', 'First thing I noticed was the crooked horizon. It would have been better to crop out that completely. Additionally the girls'' legs are cropped out, which seems odd considering there is a lot of negative space around them. Crouching down to that you were on their level and getting either a closer up view of the girls or else getting in their entire bodies would have helped.', '2005-03-16 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232062, 156431, 12750, '<td valign="top">I love this scene. They are off-centered and perfect wave coming in on them. Casually watching the sea.  Good shot!</td>', 'I love this scene. They are off-centered and perfect wave coming in on them. Casually watching the sea.  Good shot!', '2005-03-16 12:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232064, 155430, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid moment (almost a Kodak moment)... I  like it very much, although I feel the boy''s face is too shiny and highlighted.</td>', 'Very nice candid moment (almost a Kodak moment)... I  like it very much, although I feel the boy''s face is too shiny and highlighted.', '2005-03-16 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232066, 154411, 6008, '<td valign="top">The overexposed foreground is basically killing this shot. Unless you wanted it to look like he was a hellhound surrounded by flames. The perspective is good and his expression is also good, it''s just that icky golden blur in front.</td>', 'The overexposed foreground is basically killing this shot. Unless you wanted it to look like he was a hellhound surrounded by flames. The perspective is good and his expression is also good, it''s just that icky golden blur in front.', '2005-03-16 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232069, 156135, 32239, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and crop.  A tad too much saturation though.</td>', 'Nice composition and crop.  A tad too much saturation though.', '2005-03-16 12:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232071, 155431, 12750, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough it looks like that footprint is inverted. Is this intended and/or was this caused by post-editing?  I don''t think I like that effect, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Strangely enough it looks like that footprint is inverted. Is this intended and/or was this caused by post-editing?  I don''t think I like that effect, but I like the concept.', '2005-03-16 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232073, 154222, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very cute and I like the diagonal line of the water. Overall the image just seems either too sharp or has too much contrast.</td>', 'Very cute and I like the diagonal line of the water. Overall the image just seems either too sharp or has too much contrast.', '2005-03-16 12:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232076, 156537, 12750, '<td valign="top">The exposure on this shot hurts my eyes. Does not look very natural color on either bottles. Almost a green/yellow tint.</td>', 'The exposure on this shot hurts my eyes. Does not look very natural color on either bottles. Almost a green/yellow tint.', '2005-03-16 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232078, 155088, 31211, '<td valign="top">Nice and candid portrait, that depicts the confortable silent moments we somettimes share  with our friends. This could be a great entry on the "boredom challenge" as well.</td>', 'Nice and candid portrait, that depicts the confortable silent moments we somettimes share  with our friends. This could be a great entry on the "boredom challenge" as well.', '2005-03-16 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232079, 156310, 6008, '<td valign="top">Your table is crooked! I think having some other context like you in the background or something would be telling a story more. As it is this isnt really that interesting. It''s a close up shot of a drink.</td>', 'Your table is crooked! I think having some other context like you in the background or something would be telling a story more. As it is this isnt really that interesting. It''s a close up shot of a drink.', '2005-03-16 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232081, 155056, 6008, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be on the grass behind them, which is why they are both blurry and out of focus.</td>', 'The focus seems to be on the grass behind them, which is why they are both blurry and out of focus.', '2005-03-16 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
