(1232627, 155624, 19780, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture. I love the boy''s exuberance and the girls hand''s shoved in her pockets. You''ve captured the skin tones very well, which can be hard with dark skin and the lighting you''re working with. 9</td>', 'An excellent capture. I love the boy''s exuberance and the girls hand''s shoved in her pockets. You''ve captured the skin tones very well, which can be hard with dark skin and the lighting you''re working with. 9', '2005-03-16 15:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
