(1232730, 156197, 34478, '<td valign="top">I think the silhouette is nice, and the way the two figures are leaning toward each other is lovely, but I would have liked to see them framed perhaps a little further to the side, or something.  As they sit now, it seems like you wanted to centre them but didn''t quite do it.</td>', 'I think the silhouette is nice, and the way the two figures are leaning toward each other is lovely, but I would have liked to see them framed perhaps a little further to the side, or something.  As they sit now, it seems like you wanted to centre them but didn''t quite do it.', '2005-03-16 16:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
