(1232742, 156290, 34478, '<td valign="top">I think you have captured the relationship beautifully in this shot.  I also like the strong key, but would have liked a simpler background, perhaps?  Or maybe just that they weren''t standing right up against it.</td>', 'I think you have captured the relationship beautifully in this shot.  I also like the strong key, but would have liked a simpler background, perhaps?  Or maybe just that they weren''t standing right up against it.', '2005-03-16 16:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
