(1232744, 155061, 34478, '<td valign="top">Great idea... a very interesting take on the challenge, I think!  I find the shot a bit too grainy, and blown out in places... but perhaps the idea is that this is from the perspective of not having swallowed these yet!</td>', 'Great idea... a very interesting take on the challenge, I think!  I find the shot a bit too grainy, and blown out in places... but perhaps the idea is that this is from the perspective of not having swallowed these yet!', '2005-03-16 16:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
