(1232928, 155549, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, a really good naturalistic capture of these two kids. I like the soft lighting and the unusual angle. I wonder if not cropping his head off might help ... but a wonderful shot. Good luck. 8</td>', 'Nicely framed, a really good naturalistic capture of these two kids. I like the soft lighting and the unusual angle. I wonder if not cropping his head off might help ... but a wonderful shot. Good luck. 8', '2005-03-16 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
