(1232935, 155497, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this shot - I like the pose and the casualness of it. Obviously it''s a statement about supporting those around us through thick and thin, and what a wonderful concept. The colors are odd and the skin makes them look like mannequins though. Also, a little more continuous background (without that white line) would help to focus all of our attention on their eyes. I hope you''ll post the unprocessed version of it after the challenge.</td>', 'I love the idea of this shot - I like the pose and the casualness of it. Obviously it''s a statement about supporting those around us through thick and thin, and what a wonderful concept. The colors are odd and the skin makes them look like mannequins though. Also, a little more continuous background (without that white line) would help to focus all of our attention on their eyes. I hope you''ll post the unprocessed version of it after the challenge.', '2005-03-16 17:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
