(1232949, 154951, 34478, '<td valign="top">I hope they''re non-union... ;)  While their pose is interesting, and the contrast of her dress to the floor is great, the gobo, in this context, is distracting because his face is partially in a dead spot, and their skin tones are inconsistent and very amber in places.  Also, the meta-theatricality of the shot restricts your potential to show the "truth" of the bond between them.  (That, and her expression suggests she isn''t that into him)  It''s interesting... I''m glad you''ve contributed this... it''s like a picture of a picture of friendship.  It would be cool to juxtapose this shot with one of exactly the same actors in exactly the same pose but in a natural setting.</td>', 'I hope they''re non-union... ;)  While their pose is interesting, and the contrast of her dress to the floor is great, the gobo, in this context, is distracting because his face is partially in a dead spot, and their skin tones are inconsistent and very amber in places.  Also, the meta-theatricality of the shot restricts your potential to show the "truth" of the bond between them.  (That, and her expression suggests she isn''t that into him)  It''s interesting... I''m glad you''ve contributed this... it''s like a picture of a picture of friendship.  It would be cool to juxtapose this shot with one of exactly the same actors in exactly the same pose but in a natural setting.', '2005-03-16 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
