(1233244, 156447, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, and the simplicity is nice. The only drawback is that it has slightly more of a "romantic" feel about it than "best friends." Yes, they can be both, but, maybe it''s the intimate lighting that gives it the romantic emphasis. Nice job, though.</td>', 'Love the composition, and the simplicity is nice. The only drawback is that it has slightly more of a "romantic" feel about it than "best friends." Yes, they can be both, but, maybe it''s the intimate lighting that gives it the romantic emphasis. Nice job, though.', '2005-03-16 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
