(1233363, 155497, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple photo. Meets challenge well. Like the soft lighting. Only suggestion I would make is that the background would be better witout the pipe. It''s a distraction. All bricks would be good.</td>', 'Nice, simple photo. Meets challenge well. Like the soft lighting. Only suggestion I would make is that the background would be better witout the pipe. It''s a distraction. All bricks would be good.', '2005-03-16 22:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
