(1233605, 156559, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is a clever idea, and really like the background idea.  I think the only problem here is the soft focus on the ketchup and mustard bottles.  The lettering is blurred pretty badly on the ketchup bottle.  Otherwise great.</td>', 'I think this is a clever idea, and really like the background idea.  I think the only problem here is the soft focus on the ketchup and mustard bottles.  The lettering is blurred pretty badly on the ketchup bottle.  Otherwise great.', '2005-03-17 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233611, 156465, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shot is very delivers.  It would also make a great stock shot.  I think the background is a bit too overexposed, but the way this shot is set up makes me think that is intentional.  Good job.</td>', 'This shot is very delivers.  It would also make a great stock shot.  I think the background is a bit too overexposed, but the way this shot is set up makes me think that is intentional.  Good job.', '2005-03-17 00:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233619, 156495, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of Gracie and really shows off your portraiture talents.  I think the only weakness this has is in connection to the challenge.  It doesn''t really show interaction between the subjects.  The bunny is a bit of an afterthought.  Also, did the bunny claw her little face?  That might explain the choke hold!  :)</td>', 'This is a great shot of Gracie and really shows off your portraiture talents.  I think the only weakness this has is in connection to the challenge.  It doesn''t really show interaction between the subjects.  The bunny is a bit of an afterthought.  Also, did the bunny claw her little face?  That might explain the choke hold!  :)', '2005-03-17 00:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233628, 156460, 25464, '<td valign="top">The blown sky and the lens flare are distractions, and no interaction between the subjects is shown to illustrate the challenge; however, I do find something appealing about the photo as a whole and I have rated it well.  It makes me think this is the end of a chase or an exhausted collapse after excersize.  Those thoughts do tie it closer to the challenge.</td>', 'The blown sky and the lens flare are distractions, and no interaction between the subjects is shown to illustrate the challenge; however, I do find something appealing about the photo as a whole and I have rated it well.  It makes me think this is the end of a chase or an exhausted collapse after excersize.  Those thoughts do tie it closer to the challenge.', '2005-03-17 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233632, 156447, 25464, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of the I can''t believe its not butter commercials.  It is a different approach, and I think it works.</td>', 'This makes me think of the I can''t believe its not butter commercials.  It is a different approach, and I think it works.', '2005-03-17 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
