(1233655, 154416, 33749, '<td valign="top">very cute concept, but a poorly taken shot. Would have thought this should be a ''high key'' piece, not a low key one. also, gumby does not seem 100% in focus. <br/>such a shame, because i thought this was a really fun interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'very cute concept, but a poorly taken shot. Would have thought this should be a ''high key'' piece, not a low key one. also, gumby does not seem 100% in focus. such a shame, because i thought this was a really fun interpretation of the theme.', '2005-03-17 00:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
