(1234445, 155708, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge by bringing out the idiom. The white background is a bit distracting, in my opinion. Also, the reflections. I''m wishing the glint on the other peas and on the (presumed) glasses in the background were not there, and instead a bit of gloss gets placed on the two peas in the pod.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge by bringing out the idiom. The white background is a bit distracting, in my opinion. Also, the reflections. I''m wishing the glint on the other peas and on the (presumed) glasses in the background were not there, and instead a bit of gloss gets placed on the two peas in the pod.', '2005-03-17 11:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234446, 156438, 32378, '<td valign="top">Now this is best friends, love the interaction between the two of them.</td>', 'Now this is best friends, love the interaction between the two of them.', '2005-03-17 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
