(1234448, 154709, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, well done.</td>', 'Very nice picture, well done.', '2005-03-17 11:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234453, 156528, 34247, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. I like the sentiment and the interpretation for this challenge. The dark mood brings to mind the risks of not having this particular friend around. If there are objections to be made, I''d point to the reflectiveness of the condom wrapper and the nails. My instincts also tell me the writing on the t-shirt also distracts a bit. Viewed as a thumbnail, the image was very effective for me because the small size and low res reduced the two above factors, and both the head and the wrapped condom appeared disembodied. Overall, though, a top ten, even five, for me in this challenge.</td>', 'Yes it is. I like the sentiment and the interpretation for this challenge. The dark mood brings to mind the risks of not having this particular friend around. If there are objections to be made, I''d point to the reflectiveness of the condom wrapper and the nails. My instincts also tell me the writing on the t-shirt also distracts a bit. Viewed as a thumbnail, the image was very effective for me because the small size and low res reduced the two above factors, and both the head and the wrapped condom appeared disembodied. Overall, though, a top ten, even five, for me in this challenge.', '2005-03-17 11:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234464, 156573, 29269, '<td valign="top">A very nice take on the challenge. Yes, title is required in this case, but compared to all the other entries where even title can''t help them, I am bumping this up a notch.<br/>There the rule of 3rds is followed, although there is something with this image that bothers my eyes, I can''t grasp what it is right now. I''ll come back for more comments if I figure it out.<br/> <br/>I like the blurred background, although the white stand the kings are placed on is a little distracting. Also, I think I figured out what''s bothering me: the color of the background is too much like the color of the main objects. If you could have desaturated it just a weeny bit (not to lose all the color, just a little bit) or perhaps converted the whole photo to b/w, maybe it would have been better. Just a thought.<br/> <br/>I see this finishing in top 15, easy!</td>', 'A very nice take on the challenge. Yes, title is required in this case, but compared to all the other entries where even title can''t help them, I am bumping this up a notch.There the rule of 3rds is followed, although there is something with this image that bothers my eyes, I can''t grasp what it is right now. I''ll come back for more comments if I figure it out. I like the blurred background, although the white stand the kings are placed on is a little distracting. Also, I think I figured out what''s bothering me: the color of the background is too much like the color of the main objects. If you could have desaturated it just a weeny bit (not to lose all the color, just a little bit) or perhaps converted the whole photo to b/w, maybe it would have been better. Just a thought. I see this finishing in top 15, easy!', '2005-03-17 11:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234465, 154798, 34247, '<td valign="top">I''m reading this as one friend, rather than best friends. But I do like the pix''s tones and that''s why I''m rating this higher than 99 per cent of the people shots that were submitted for this challenge. Bringing down the light level and emphasizing the two eyes might be an interesting exercise, imho.</td>', 'I''m reading this as one friend, rather than best friends. But I do like the pix''s tones and that''s why I''m rating this higher than 99 per cent of the people shots that were submitted for this challenge. Bringing down the light level and emphasizing the two eyes might be an interesting exercise, imho.', '2005-03-17 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234472, 155714, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is very cute, but the top of the yellow lab''s head looks smudged for some reason... 6.</td>', 'this is very cute, but the top of the yellow lab''s head looks smudged for some reason... 6.', '2005-03-17 11:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234474, 155562, 32378, '<td valign="top">The picture is kind of small, but I don''t see how this fits into the challenge at all.</td>', 'The picture is kind of small, but I don''t see how this fits into the challenge at all.', '2005-03-17 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234476, 154609, 32378, '<td valign="top">The picute is too small for me to even determine that these people know each other.</td>', 'The picute is too small for me to even determine that these people know each other.', '2005-03-17 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234477, 155061, 32378, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge.', '2005-03-17 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234479, 156539, 34247, '<td valign="top">I laughed so hard, I almost fell out of the chair. In a challenge portfolio filled with so many trite animal shots, this one was a pleasant surprise. I''m wondering if the shadow on the lower right hand corner is a bit of a distraction. I''m also thinking a shift to expose a fraction more of the object of desire (even some sort of a look at the face) would produce a more interesting shot. The trees in the background were distracting a bit, but of course I understand that short of photoshopping it out, it would have been impossible to achieve a blue sky. (I presume you couldn''t direct the subjects to "shift a bit to the left" or to pose in a different location. haha.</td>', 'I laughed so hard, I almost fell out of the chair. In a challenge portfolio filled with so many trite animal shots, this one was a pleasant surprise. I''m wondering if the shadow on the lower right hand corner is a bit of a distraction. I''m also thinking a shift to expose a fraction more of the object of desire (even some sort of a look at the face) would produce a more interesting shot. The trees in the background were distracting a bit, but of course I understand that short of photoshopping it out, it would have been impossible to achieve a blue sky. (I presume you couldn''t direct the subjects to "shift a bit to the left" or to pose in a different location. haha.', '2005-03-17 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234487, 156559, 31905, '<td valign="top">I dont know but very simila to a theme selected by someone else in the challenge. Would''t you agree?</td>', 'I dont know but very simila to a theme selected by someone else in the challenge. Would''t you agree?', '2005-03-17 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234502, 155739, 34478, '<td valign="top">The two figures blend into the background here.  The location is lovely, and the idea is nice, but I want to see more isolation of the ''friends'', and perhaps the shot taken from a different angle, so that the ladder isn''t in the way.</td>', 'The two figures blend into the background here.  The location is lovely, and the idea is nice, but I want to see more isolation of the ''friends'', and perhaps the shot taken from a different angle, so that the ladder isn''t in the way.', '2005-03-17 12:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234530, 156067, 34478, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  The blown-out hands are a bit distracting, but I like the idea.</td>', 'Nice colours.  The blown-out hands are a bit distracting, but I like the idea.', '2005-03-17 12:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234535, 156041, 34247, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a different crop on this, perhaps centering the subject and playing more on the image in the water, perhaps forming a cross-like structure?</td>', 'I''d like to see a different crop on this, perhaps centering the subject and playing more on the image in the water, perhaps forming a cross-like structure?', '2005-03-17 12:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
