(1236455, 156393, 20462, '<td valign="top">Take out that dog.  And the picture is 10x better. You should have cropped out the stuff intruding on the left, but otherwise I really kind of like this one.  Maybe I just have a soft spot for all wrinkled and bemused.</td>', 'Take out that dog.  And the picture is 10x better. You should have cropped out the stuff intruding on the left, but otherwise I really kind of like this one.  Maybe I just have a soft spot for all wrinkled and bemused.', '2005-03-18 16:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1236463, 154419, 20462, '<td valign="top">Now this is by far, one of, if not the best pictures that try to introduce the idea of friendship between a human and non-human counterpart.  I like the b/w choice, the expressions, even the background and rope.  One of my top 5.  well done.</td>', 'Now this is by far, one of, if not the best pictures that try to introduce the idea of friendship between a human and non-human counterpart.  I like the b/w choice, the expressions, even the background and rope.  One of my top 5.  well done.', '2005-03-18 16:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1236464, 154774, 20462, '<td valign="top">unusual colors.  wish we could see the other persons face.  good effort.</td>', 'unusual colors.  wish we could see the other persons face.  good effort.', '2005-03-18 16:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1236465, 156534, 20462, '<td valign="top">really, how can one not warm up to this picture.  Good effort and use of "other" lighting.  I just wish the composition was a little stronger.</td>', 'really, how can one not warm up to this picture.  Good effort and use of "other" lighting.  I just wish the composition was a little stronger.', '2005-03-18 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
