(1236489, 156492, 20462, '<td valign="top">I like the grain in this one.  I don''t like the cropping choice.  But I bet the subjects were laughing legimately.  At least, I would like to hope so.  good effort.</td>', 'I like the grain in this one.  I don''t like the cropping choice.  But I bet the subjects were laughing legimately.  At least, I would like to hope so.  good effort.', '2005-03-18 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
