(1236823, 155549, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice job!<br/> <br/> <br/>I love the angle of the picture....few critiques though..<br/> <br/>When I look at this picture  the "emotion" from the kids  to the photographer is more dominant than the their bond with eachother.  I would like to have seen something a little less posed and more candid.....maybe of them interacting with eachother.  This would emphasis their friendship instead of their relationship with the camera.  Also the focus seems just a bit soft.<br/> <br/>Cute kids.  Love the white background.  Nice exposure....nothing is over or underexposed.  Don''t get me wrong, the picture is great and should probably be one that you frame and hang on the wall.<br/> <br/>Best of luck,<br/> <br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'Nice job!  I love the angle of the picture....few critiques though.. When I look at this picture  the "emotion" from the kids  to the photographer is more dominant than the their bond with eachother.  I would like to have seen something a little less posed and more candid.....maybe of them interacting with eachother.  This would emphasis their friendship instead of their relationship with the camera.  Also the focus seems just a bit soft. Cute kids.  Love the white background.  Nice exposure....nothing is over or underexposed.  Don''t get me wrong, the picture is great and should probably be one that you frame and hang on the wall. Best of luck,  Chris A', '2005-03-18 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1236827, 155739, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Composition is good.  The subjects are a little underexposed.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Composition is good.  The subjects are a little underexposed.', '2005-03-18 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1236831, 155671, 31213, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh.  Terrible focus.  Love the composition, though I''d appreciate it more if you had a small backlight on your subject to "bring them out" of the black background.  As is, they sort of get lost in the background and feel flat and two dimentional.</td>', 'Ahhhh.  Terrible focus.  Love the composition, though I''d appreciate it more if you had a small backlight on your subject to "bring them out" of the black background.  As is, they sort of get lost in the background and feel flat and two dimentional.', '2005-03-18 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
