(1238328, 156130, 20168, '<td valign="top">Closest part of image is blurred just a tad, which adds to the sense of motion.  I love the two different expressions on these boys faces, that of fear and delight, two of the most common human expressions, often mixed in the same head at the same time.  Great shot!</td>', 'Closest part of image is blurred just a tad, which adds to the sense of motion.  I love the two different expressions on these boys faces, that of fear and delight, two of the most common human expressions, often mixed in the same head at the same time.  Great shot!', '2005-03-20 01:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1238330, 155487, 20168, '<td valign="top">Pushes beyond the ordinary, simply by the taking these two seniors from behind, as though we, the younger generation looking ahead at them looking ahead, across the waters of time.  I would have loved for the waters to have more clarity, but the future is never all that clear now is it.  Thanks for an excellent entry.</td>', 'Pushes beyond the ordinary, simply by the taking these two seniors from behind, as though we, the younger generation looking ahead at them looking ahead, across the waters of time.  I would have loved for the waters to have more clarity, but the future is never all that clear now is it.  Thanks for an excellent entry.', '2005-03-20 01:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1238332, 156464, 20168, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit "flat" as they say in drama, with only the profile of faces and a flat backdrop.  The shot lacks sharpness, but the two expressions are adorable.  Lovely "best friends" photo idea.</td>', 'The composition is a bit "flat" as they say in drama, with only the profile of faces and a flat backdrop.  The shot lacks sharpness, but the two expressions are adorable.  Lovely "best friends" photo idea.', '2005-03-20 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1238333, 156011, 20168, '<td valign="top">My only crit is that I''d prefer a closer crop to bring these two closer to me as a viewer so that I could appreciate the expressios in their faces as they play.  I love the lighting and composition of the horses.</td>', 'My only crit is that I''d prefer a closer crop to bring these two closer to me as a viewer so that I could appreciate the expressios in their faces as they play.  I love the lighting and composition of the horses.', '2005-03-20 01:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
