(1238363, 156530, 20168, '<td valign="top">Over exposed and cropped off too much.  Since the human hand is your subject, we need to see the whole hand, including the details of the hand.  I like the lighting concept.  The title leaves me wondering.  I love the simplicity of a human hand for best friends.  Outside the box.</td>', 'Over exposed and cropped off too much.  Since the human hand is your subject, we need to see the whole hand, including the details of the hand.  I like the lighting concept.  The title leaves me wondering.  I love the simplicity of a human hand for best friends.  Outside the box.', '2005-03-20 02:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
