(1238368, 156470, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lighting needs some improvement.  I''m so new to digital photography as to only know when I see lighting that works great and lighting that could be better.  Perhaps a secondary source.  I like the natural candid sense on the faces of these two teens doing what teen kid best friends  love to do.</td>', 'Lighting needs some improvement.  I''m so new to digital photography as to only know when I see lighting that works great and lighting that could be better.  Perhaps a secondary source.  I like the natural candid sense on the faces of these two teens doing what teen kid best friends  love to do.', '2005-03-20 02:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
