(1238376, 155497, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  God bless you two as you lean on each other through the tough times!  I love the expressions on the faces of these two friends, joyful though having suffered, and confident-supportive.</td>', 'Great shot!  God bless you two as you lean on each other through the tough times!  I love the expressions on the faces of these two friends, joyful though having suffered, and confident-supportive.', '2005-03-20 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
