(1239820, 156457, 33749, '<td valign="top">his face seems to lack definiton... and his pose seems a little unnatural.</td>', 'his face seems to lack definiton... and his pose seems a little unnatural.', '2005-03-21 00:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239911, 155387, 10261, '<td valign="top">The title is probably an accurate assessment of the relationship between these birds, but coexistence is an association a bit looser than friendship, which is the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>On a technical note: This seems a bit overexposed. The detail on the white duck is washed out, and the the shadows below the other duck''s head blur the boundary between the bird and the water. You might be able to bring some of the detail back by adjusting the curves or reducing the contrast.</td>', 'The title is probably an accurate assessment of the relationship between these birds, but coexistence is an association a bit looser than friendship, which is the challenge topic. On a technical note: This seems a bit overexposed. The detail on the white duck is washed out, and the the shadows below the other duck''s head blur the boundary between the bird and the water. You might be able to bring some of the detail back by adjusting the curves or reducing the contrast.', '2005-03-21 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239915, 156187, 23278, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual perspective on this one...</td>', 'I like the unusual perspective on this one...', '2005-03-21 01:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239925, 156564, 23278, '<td valign="top">Have to say, I am not a big fan of hand guns, or the bible, especially not together. The photograph is very well taken.</td>', 'Have to say, I am not a big fan of hand guns, or the bible, especially not together. The photograph is very well taken.', '2005-03-21 01:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239940, 156213, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about the composition here doesn''t feel right. There seems to be a lot of visual clutter used to convey the idea that a poker game is in progress. I would have liked this shot better if it had been cropped so that the cards were closer to the bottom left corner. This would eliminate some of the foreground items which both steal attention from the subject (the kings) and offer only redundant information (''poker game in progress'').</td>', 'Something about the composition here doesn''t feel right. There seems to be a lot of visual clutter used to convey the idea that a poker game is in progress. I would have liked this shot better if it had been cropped so that the cards were closer to the bottom left corner. This would eliminate some of the foreground items which both steal attention from the subject (the kings) and offer only redundant information (''poker game in progress'').', '2005-03-21 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239975, 155929, 10261, '<td valign="top">This picture is too small to make out much detail on. The girl on the right blends in a bit too much with the background, and the shot is framed with the subjects too close to the center for my taste. Incorporating the bridge as a thematic element with metaphorical significance might have made this a more powerful image; as presented here it just seems like part of the background.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This picture is too small to make out much detail on. The girl on the right blends in a bit too much with the background, and the shot is framed with the subjects too close to the center for my taste. Incorporating the bridge as a thematic element with metaphorical significance might have made this a more powerful image; as presented here it just seems like part of the background. ', '2005-03-21 01:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239986, 155993, 10261, '<td valign="top">Both of these kids seem more interested in something happening off camera than in participating in the shot. Cropping the image so close to the girl''s eyes emphasizes the fact that she''s looking elsewhere.</td>', 'Both of these kids seem more interested in something happening off camera than in participating in the shot. Cropping the image so close to the girl''s eyes emphasizes the fact that she''s looking elsewhere.', '2005-03-21 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1239993, 156038, 10261, '<td valign="top">Having the cat''s ear so close to the girl''s eye creates unnecessary visual tension.</td>', 'Having the cat''s ear so close to the girl''s eye creates unnecessary visual tension.', '2005-03-21 01:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240008, 156558, 10261, '<td valign="top">Framing this shot so that the girls were closer to the bottom right of the image might have improved the composition. I''d like to see a bit more of what they''re looking at, even if it''s only more of the ocean.</td>', 'Framing this shot so that the girls were closer to the bottom right of the image might have improved the composition. I''d like to see a bit more of what they''re looking at, even if it''s only more of the ocean.', '2005-03-21 01:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240020, 155264, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture, but the composition feels better suited for a family album than a photographic competition. If I knew these kids I''d love to have this picture on my desk; but since I don''t, there''s nothing about either the content or technique that jumps out at me or gives the picture any real significance.</td>', 'This is a cute picture, but the composition feels better suited for a family album than a photographic competition. If I knew these kids I''d love to have this picture on my desk; but since I don''t, there''s nothing about either the content or technique that jumps out at me or gives the picture any real significance.', '2005-03-21 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240025, 156455, 10261, '<td valign="top">The lines in the pavement are a bit distracting, and nothing about the image really conveys the concept of friendship.</td>', 'The lines in the pavement are a bit distracting, and nothing about the image really conveys the concept of friendship.', '2005-03-21 01:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
