(1241185, 156582, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot.  I think it really shows the bond between a mother and daughter, despite all of thier differences, they will always have a special bond.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot.  I think it really shows the bond between a mother and daughter, despite all of thier differences, they will always have a special bond.', '2005-03-21 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
