(1241341, 154811, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the feeling of the photo. Perfect fit for this challenge, plus, I like the fact that it not your typical boy and dog shot. Very nice.</td>', 'Like the feeling of the photo. Perfect fit for this challenge, plus, I like the fact that it not your typical boy and dog shot. Very nice.', '2005-03-21 16:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241342, 155624, 34980, '<td valign="top">my neighborhood!!!!</td>', 'my neighborhood!!!!', '2005-03-21 16:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241346, 156573, 33947, '<td valign="top">Catchy concept. Love the simplicity of the composition with the blurred board in the background. Nice job.</td>', 'Catchy concept. Love the simplicity of the composition with the blurred board in the background. Nice job.', '2005-03-21 16:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241348, 154944, 34980, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-03-21 16:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241373, 154958, 33652, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Perfect composition. My money''s on a ribbon........</td>', 'Great shot. Perfect composition. My money''s on a ribbon........', '2005-03-21 16:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241383, 155371, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this, it fits the challenge well, but it appears to have too much contrast to me- the girls sweaters are very dark while their headresses are almost too light; great smiles, they look genuine, not just for the camera</td>', 'I like this, it fits the challenge well, but it appears to have too much contrast to me- the girls sweaters are very dark while their headresses are almost too light; great smiles, they look genuine, not just for the camera', '2005-03-21 16:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241408, 155200, 20803, '<td valign="top">Looks amazing, but not sure how this fits into the "Best Friends" theme...</td>', 'Looks amazing, but not sure how this fits into the "Best Friends" theme...', '2005-03-21 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241442, 155487, 3569, '<td valign="top">great subject and shot</td>', 'great subject and shot', '2005-03-21 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241450, 156535, 3569, '<td valign="top">beautiful bee, but no freiends seen here.</td>', 'beautiful bee, but no freiends seen here.', '2005-03-21 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241471, 155456, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful big sister shot.</td>', 'wonderful big sister shot.', '2005-03-21 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241530, 156559, 14614, '<td valign="top">The mayo makes the shot!  Good use of humor. Only suggestion is a bit more crispness on the left of the ketchup.</td>', 'The mayo makes the shot!  Good use of humor. Only suggestion is a bit more crispness on the left of the ketchup.', '2005-03-21 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241534, 155430, 7774, '<td valign="top">would have given it more than 5 if I could see more of the boy''s face</td>', 'would have given it more than 5 if I could see more of the boy''s face', '2005-03-21 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241535, 156460, 35284, '<td valign="top">Better protecting lens from flare, though nice comp.</td>', 'Better protecting lens from flare, though nice comp.', '2005-03-21 17:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241551, 156074, 35284, '<td valign="top">I suggest cropping a bit from right. Otherwise, like it.</td>', 'I suggest cropping a bit from right. Otherwise, like it.', '2005-03-21 17:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241562, 154984, 35284, '<td valign="top">Too much noise on BG. Try Neat Image. Otherwise, wonderful shot.</td>', 'Too much noise on BG. Try Neat Image. Otherwise, wonderful shot.', '2005-03-21 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241584, 154651, 33942, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! Classic silhouettes. 10</td>', 'Lovely shot! Classic silhouettes. 10', '2005-03-21 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241592, 156470, 33942, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been better if you had used seperate light sources for the subjects and if the girl on the right wasn''t leaning against the divider. Good idea though.</td>', 'This shot would have been better if you had used seperate light sources for the subjects and if the girl on the right wasn''t leaning against the divider. Good idea though.', '2005-03-21 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241636, 156227, 20803, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, good pose and great expression on the model''s face.  Unfortunately the photo does not evoke any impression of "Best Friends" therefore the low rating.  Otherwise a 7.</td>', 'Good lighting, good pose and great expression on the model''s face.  Unfortunately the photo does not evoke any impression of "Best Friends" therefore the low rating.  Otherwise a 7.', '2005-03-21 18:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241643, 155264, 20803, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - of all the photos I have seen this one captures the "essence of the moment" between two friends - the expressions on the girls'' faces is delightful. Great use of fill-in flash, good composition.  Try to see what a close crop just on the faces will look like!</td>', 'Brilliant - of all the photos I have seen this one captures the "essence of the moment" between two friends - the expressions on the girls'' faces is delightful. Great use of fill-in flash, good composition.  Try to see what a close crop just on the faces will look like!', '2005-03-21 18:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241649, 154798, 20803, '<td valign="top">A beautifully executed photograph - great lighting and composition, captivating look in the model''s eyes.  I would have given this an 8 if it were more in the theme, but I do not see the "Best Friends" topic coming through here.  You may want to submit this in other rounds where it would fit better?</td>', 'A beautifully executed photograph - great lighting and composition, captivating look in the model''s eyes.  I would have given this an 8 if it were more in the theme, but I do not see the "Best Friends" topic coming through here.  You may want to submit this in other rounds where it would fit better?', '2005-03-21 18:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241655, 156528, 20803, '<td valign="top">This is one of the rare photos in this competition where a single person still fits within the theme.  Through the expression on the model''s face, this photo brings across a somewhat cynical message very clearly.  Well done.</td>', 'This is one of the rare photos in this competition where a single person still fits within the theme.  Through the expression on the model''s face, this photo brings across a somewhat cynical message very clearly.  Well done.', '2005-03-21 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241666, 155088, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Like the lighting on the boy in front. Wish both kids had been in focus...would have put the emphasis more both kids and their friendship, instead of on the one in front.</td>', 'Nice idea. Like the lighting on the boy in front. Wish both kids had been in focus...would have put the emphasis more both kids and their friendship, instead of on the one in front.', '2005-03-21 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241678, 155797, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the feeling of this photo, and like that it''s not cluttered with extaneous objects...often hard to do outside. Meets challenge very well. Like the sepia.</td>', 'Like the feeling of this photo, and like that it''s not cluttered with extaneous objects...often hard to do outside. Meets challenge very well. Like the sepia.', '2005-03-21 18:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241709, 156552, 31213, '<td valign="top">Cool picture but doesn''t really represent Best Friends.  I think voters are looking for interaction between two people.</td>', 'Cool picture but doesn''t really represent Best Friends.  I think voters are looking for interaction between two people.', '2005-03-21 19:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241711, 156159, 31213, '<td valign="top">Out of focus!</td>', 'Out of focus!', '2005-03-21 19:10:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1241713, 155193, 31213, '<td valign="top">This is a reach for best friends!  I think people are looking for a more literal representation.</td>', 'This is a reach for best friends!  I think people are looking for a more literal representation.', '2005-03-21 19:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241722, 156538, 31213, '<td valign="top">Aside from the obvious dodging around the camels and the lack of saturation....nice shot.  Very cool looking animals and I like the composure with the tree in the background balancing out the shot.</td>', 'Aside from the obvious dodging around the camels and the lack of saturation....nice shot.  Very cool looking animals and I like the composure with the tree in the background balancing out the shot.', '2005-03-21 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241725, 156416, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like this a lot.  Visually confusing but very nice once you spend a few seconds looking at it.  Great work!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice!  I like this a lot.  Visually confusing but very nice once you spend a few seconds looking at it.  Great work! ', '2005-03-21 19:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241729, 155357, 31213, '<td valign="top">I''ve always loved your work with these guys.  Lighting is awesome, composure is perfect.  8! with a possible bumb</td>', 'I''ve always loved your work with these guys.  Lighting is awesome, composure is perfect.  8! with a possible bumb', '2005-03-21 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241731, 155832, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great exposure!  Amazed at how you exposed for botht the bright sky and your subject....thats really tough to do.....bet you used a strong flash.  I like it</td>', 'Great exposure!  Amazed at how you exposed for botht the bright sky and your subject....thats really tough to do.....bet you used a strong flash.  I like it', '2005-03-21 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241748, 156452, 19575, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, think the composition could be better</td>', 'I really like the concept, think the composition could be better', '2005-03-21 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241751, 154869, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting! 8</td>', 'Love the lighting! 8', '2005-03-21 19:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241752, 156573, 19575, '<td valign="top">great composition, fulfills the challenge, but is also a good shot</td>', 'great composition, fulfills the challenge, but is also a good shot', '2005-03-21 19:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241755, 154326, 19575, '<td valign="top">they sure look like best friends!</td>', 'they sure look like best friends!', '2005-03-21 19:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241757, 154942, 31213, '<td valign="top">ahhhh.  Love the picture hate the cheesy fuzzy blur you hastily slapped on the border.  Damn you! 7 anyway, would have been a 9 or ten otherwise. :(</td>', 'ahhhh.  Love the picture hate the cheesy fuzzy blur you hastily slapped on the border.  Damn you! 7 anyway, would have been a 9 or ten otherwise. :(', '2005-03-21 19:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241758, 156584, 19575, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, wrong challenge, or maybe a better headline</td>', 'Nice photo, wrong challenge, or maybe a better headline', '2005-03-21 19:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241760, 155456, 19575, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and capture of the moment</td>', 'Excellent lighting and capture of the moment', '2005-03-21 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241761, 156228, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the clarity and lighting.  The expressions are very candid and unique.  It''s unscripted, un-posed....something only a great photographer with comfortable communication with their subjects can obtain.  Outstanding work.  Should finish high :)<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Wow!  Love the clarity and lighting.  The expressions are very candid and unique.  It''s unscripted, un-posed....something only a great photographer with comfortable communication with their subjects can obtain.  Outstanding work.  Should finish high :) 9', '2005-03-21 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241763, 154422, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very unique capture.  Lvoe it!</td>', 'Very unique capture.  Lvoe it!', '2005-03-21 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241765, 154894, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful girl!  Can I be next?  7 with possible bump</td>', 'Wow, beautiful girl!  Can I be next?  7 with possible bump', '2005-03-21 19:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241770, 156447, 31213, '<td valign="top">Beautiful low key lighting.  Goodluck!</td>', 'Beautiful low key lighting.  Goodluck!', '2005-03-21 19:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241772, 155487, 31213, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh....what a relaxing moment.  I feel better just viewing this picture....it takes me there.  Nice job.</td>', 'Ahhhh....what a relaxing moment.  I feel better just viewing this picture....it takes me there.  Nice job.', '2005-03-21 19:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241774, 154913, 31213, '<td valign="top">Seen a bunch of other duck shots....this one is the best yet in this challenge.  Good job not oversaturating....very sharp too.  7 for now.</td>', 'Seen a bunch of other duck shots....this one is the best yet in this challenge.  Good job not oversaturating....very sharp too.  7 for now.', '2005-03-21 19:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
