(1242186, 154602, 23680, '<td valign="top">Now this is a beautiful "pet and cute kid" picture.  I don''t think best friends actually have to be human, I know mine isn''t.  Very nice uncluttered background, good color and composition.  Maybe if you hadn''t cut off poor Scott''s feet, that would be my only complaint</td>', 'Now this is a beautiful "pet and cute kid" picture.  I don''t think best friends actually have to be human, I know mine isn''t.  Very nice uncluttered background, good color and composition.  Maybe if you hadn''t cut off poor Scott''s feet, that would be my only complaint', '2005-03-21 23:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242190, 155462, 23680, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, they look like they''re up to something!!!  Background is a little blown out and I wish you hadn''t cut off their heads, but all and all I like it!</td>', 'Oh yeah, they look like they''re up to something!!!  Background is a little blown out and I wish you hadn''t cut off their heads, but all and all I like it!', '2005-03-21 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
