(1242486, 156399, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love juxtaposition in an image...this contrast of boxing/tough/punch/power with glamour/soft/feminine/vulnerable.  Great lighting. Beautiful portrait.  Sent it to Clint.</td>', 'I love juxtaposition in an image...this contrast of boxing/tough/punch/power with glamour/soft/feminine/vulnerable.  Great lighting. Beautiful portrait.  Sent it to Clint.', '2005-03-22 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
