(1242488, 155995, 20168, '<td valign="top">Flash candid of a child...beautiful face, slightly blurred, foreground distracts, perhaps pulling in the crop a bit more to focus just upon the face?  Lovely childhood memory.</td>', 'Flash candid of a child...beautiful face, slightly blurred, foreground distracts, perhaps pulling in the crop a bit more to focus just upon the face?  Lovely childhood memory.', '2005-03-22 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242490, 155922, 20168, '<td valign="top">Perhaps using your whole alloted 640 would bring this image closer to us.  The brightness/contrast, or hue/sat was pushed to high in my opinion.  Composition cuts off words at the top, and figure shapes at the bottom.  Dreamlike, clownlike, eccentric photo.</td>', 'Perhaps using your whole alloted 640 would bring this image closer to us.  The brightness/contrast, or hue/sat was pushed to high in my opinion.  Composition cuts off words at the top, and figure shapes at the bottom.  Dreamlike, clownlike, eccentric photo.', '2005-03-22 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242491, 156582, 35304, '<td valign="top">I believe they are...composition, color, depth of field and emotion.  great shot</td>', 'I believe they are...composition, color, depth of field and emotion.  great shot', '2005-03-22 00:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242492, 154651, 20168, '<td valign="top">Evokes "Bridge to Terebithia" in my imagination.  I love the silhouetted images at sunset.  The boy''s tophat is a cool idea.  The jacket/pants on the girl takes away from her feminine mystique.  A girls bonnet and dress, or big boots and fishing pole, would evoke more imagination of where these two are heading, what kind of adventure.</td>', 'Evokes "Bridge to Terebithia" in my imagination.  I love the silhouetted images at sunset.  The boy''s tophat is a cool idea.  The jacket/pants on the girl takes away from her feminine mystique.  A girls bonnet and dress, or big boots and fishing pole, would evoke more imagination of where these two are heading, what kind of adventure.', '2005-03-22 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242494, 156154, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great strong color contrasts, with black/browns on white/flesh-tones.  The central location of the jewelry and the focus of the girls attention on the clasp give this photo a good energy.  Cool work.</td>', 'Great strong color contrasts, with black/browns on white/flesh-tones.  The central location of the jewelry and the focus of the girls attention on the clasp give this photo a good energy.  Cool work.', '2005-03-22 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242496, 155624, 35304, '<td valign="top">Composition, rich textures with energy , very nice shot</td>', 'Composition, rich textures with energy , very nice shot', '2005-03-22 00:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242502, 156552, 20168, '<td valign="top">Stretching the central point of the challenge... but who cares really.  The photo is strong, gorgeous colors, beautiful lines. My only small crit is the cropping out of the tree in the far upper left, which distracts a bit from the movement of the tree in the middle reaching up into that corner.</td>', 'Stretching the central point of the challenge... but who cares really.  The photo is strong, gorgeous colors, beautiful lines. My only small crit is the cropping out of the tree in the far upper left, which distracts a bit from the movement of the tree in the middle reaching up into that corner.', '2005-03-22 00:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242507, 156290, 20168, '<td valign="top">Why not use their paragliding equipment as background rather than this tongue &amp; groove wall.  The posed faces are great, full of vitality.  I just want to see these men connecting with their sport.</td>', 'Why not use their paragliding equipment as background rather than this tongue & groove wall.  The posed faces are great, full of vitality.  I just want to see these men connecting with their sport.', '2005-03-22 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242509, 154771, 20168, '<td valign="top">The light falls strongest on the ball, giving away the photographer''s bias in this "best friends" love/hate friendship.  The bat is too dull, out of focus or simply not well lit.  Nice compositional choices.</td>', 'The light falls strongest on the ball, giving away the photographer''s bias in this "best friends" love/hate friendship.  The bat is too dull, out of focus or simply not well lit.  Nice compositional choices.', '2005-03-22 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
