(1244033, 155264, 17103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, one of my favorites... and I love their pigtails! :) 10</td>', 'Beautiful, one of my favorites... and I love their pigtails! :) 10', '2005-03-22 21:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244035, 155672, 33947, '<td valign="top">Anybody''s who''s had a "ball dog" knows how well this photo fits the challenge. Nice shot of the dog, I just wish the background were different...it''s distracting.</td>', 'Anybody''s who''s had a "ball dog" knows how well this photo fits the challenge. Nice shot of the dog, I just wish the background were different...it''s distracting.', '2005-03-22 21:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244046, 155462, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Thai kids, Spanish title, same muted colors as a certain Wisdom photo... hi, Pedro! I have a similar reaction to this photo as your Lines portrait- the models and composition (less so on this one) remind me very much of Librodo, but the colors and lighting just aren''t the same.<br/> <br/>The lack of shadow detail isn''t Manny''s style, and the colors remind me of when I had my camera set to an Adobe RGB color space. It''s a good photo, and should score fine, but ya'' gotta find a way to bottle some Librodo and bring it back home. Of course, if this turns out to be his, I''ll be going into hiding for a while. ;-)</td>', 'Hmm... Thai kids, Spanish title, same muted colors as a certain Wisdom photo... hi, Pedro! I have a similar reaction to this photo as your Lines portrait- the models and composition (less so on this one) remind me very much of Librodo, but the colors and lighting just aren''t the same. The lack of shadow detail isn''t Manny''s style, and the colors remind me of when I had my camera set to an Adobe RGB color space. It''s a good photo, and should score fine, but ya'' gotta find a way to bottle some Librodo and bring it back home. Of course, if this turns out to be his, I''ll be going into hiding for a while. ;-)', '2005-03-22 21:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244051, 156416, 33947, '<td valign="top">I very much like how this photo fits the challenge, and I love the soft lighting. I''m a little disappointed with the background, though. It''s distracting.</td>', 'I very much like how this photo fits the challenge, and I love the soft lighting. I''m a little disappointed with the background, though. It''s distracting.', '2005-03-22 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244062, 156539, 23680, '<td valign="top">OMG that is too funny :)</td>', 'OMG that is too funny :)', '2005-03-22 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244064, 156482, 23680, '<td valign="top">Yes, definitely best friends - only my best friend could tweak my nose without getting bopped on the head :)  I like your shot, good composition, no distracting background and I like the use of Black and White</td>', 'Yes, definitely best friends - only my best friend could tweak my nose without getting bopped on the head :)  I like your shot, good composition, no distracting background and I like the use of Black and White', '2005-03-22 22:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244065, 156355, 23680, '<td valign="top">I thought that was what they were doing - too funny - nice setting, mountains are beautiful, father and son just look a little soft -</td>', 'I thought that was what they were doing - too funny - nice setting, mountains are beautiful, father and son just look a little soft -', '2005-03-22 22:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244067, 154326, 23680, '<td valign="top">How adorable are they - I like the fact that you filled the frame with their faces</td>', 'How adorable are they - I like the fact that you filled the frame with their faces', '2005-03-22 22:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244071, 156285, 23680, '<td valign="top">What the heck is this? Aside from that, I don''t care for the composition and I don''t think it fits the challenge at all.  I don''t think fitting the challenge is the be-all-end-all, but it has to have some small resemblence to it or at least look like the photographer tried to make a shot that fit.  This doesn''t at all.</td>', 'What the heck is this? Aside from that, I don''t care for the composition and I don''t think it fits the challenge at all.  I don''t think fitting the challenge is the be-all-end-all, but it has to have some small resemblence to it or at least look like the photographer tried to make a shot that fit.  This doesn''t at all.', '2005-03-22 22:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244072, 156138, 23680, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is original.  I would have like to see this without the red in the bottom right corner.  I like the border on this particular shot</td>', 'Okay, this is original.  I would have like to see this without the red in the bottom right corner.  I like the border on this particular shot', '2005-03-22 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244073, 156447, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, lots spoken with this shot and not a face in it.   good job</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, lots spoken with this shot and not a face in it.   good job', '2005-03-22 22:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244076, 156457, 23680, '<td valign="top">Adorable faces, both of them.  I like the use of black and white and the softness of this</td>', 'Adorable faces, both of them.  I like the use of black and white and the softness of this', '2005-03-22 22:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244078, 156470, 23680, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, reminds me of a movie "Bye Bye Birdie" (I think).  Looks a little off on the color, has a yellow cast, maybe white balance problem?</td>', 'Cute idea, reminds me of a movie "Bye Bye Birdie" (I think).  Looks a little off on the color, has a yellow cast, maybe white balance problem?', '2005-03-22 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244079, 155664, 23680, '<td valign="top">Why the yellow border?</td>', 'Why the yellow border?', '2005-03-22 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244082, 156143, 32672, '<td valign="top">They say that pets and owners start to look alike after awhile, I never believe dit until now.  I just hope I don''t look like my parrot (then again, he''s green, I have olive skin, he ha a rather large beak, and I''ve heard that my nose is a little on the big side...uh-oh).  Anyway, your photo really made me smile.  Very cute.</td>', 'They say that pets and owners start to look alike after awhile, I never believe dit until now.  I just hope I don''t look like my parrot (then again, he''s green, I have olive skin, he ha a rather large beak, and I''ve heard that my nose is a little on the big side...uh-oh).  Anyway, your photo really made me smile.  Very cute.', '2005-03-22 22:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244083, 156471, 23680, '<td valign="top">I can fully understand the human/canine bond, but this is just a little disturbing, sorry.  Other than that, nice colors and composition.</td>', 'I can fully understand the human/canine bond, but this is just a little disturbing, sorry.  Other than that, nice colors and composition.', '2005-03-22 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
