(1244340, 155462, 6349, '<td valign="top">Knew this was yours.  Great shot.  I think the redness hurt your score a lot here.  For me, it works well, as the red plays a major role in pulling the image together, but the red in the skin tones and shadows is a bit much, especially under the eyes of the kid on the right.  I think a black and white version would have scored higher despite losing the impact of the color theme.</td>', 'Knew this was yours.  Great shot.  I think the redness hurt your score a lot here.  For me, it works well, as the red plays a major role in pulling the image together, but the red in the skin tones and shadows is a bit much, especially under the eyes of the kid on the right.  I think a black and white version would have scored higher despite losing the impact of the color theme.', '2005-03-23 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
