(1244402, 156228, 14386, '<td valign="top">Actually, when I submitted this shot, I never thought it would ribbon.  I need a confirmation and a friend told me it will do well. I showed it to the mother of the girl in the background and she was almost in tears.  It must be good, so I said.   But the best friend connection is not so strong.  Thus, this getting a ribbon is really a big thing for me.  Finally, I have one this year.  Now I can take a rest for a while and concentrate on my work...<br/> <br/>Thanks to you all for voting this high...no 1s and 2s...yeheyyy!!!! Thanks to all those who chose this a s a favorite.  I am getting farther and farther from my subjects and including more and more context.  Your appreciations are helping me achieve a kind of portrait for me.  Thanks everyone.</td>', 'Actually, when I submitted this shot, I never thought it would ribbon.  I need a confirmation and a friend told me it will do well. I showed it to the mother of the girl in the background and she was almost in tears.  It must be good, so I said.   But the best friend connection is not so strong.  Thus, this getting a ribbon is really a big thing for me.  Finally, I have one this year.  Now I can take a rest for a while and concentrate on my work... Thanks to you all for voting this high...no 1s and 2s...yeheyyy!!!! Thanks to all those who chose this a s a favorite.  I am getting farther and farther from my subjects and including more and more context.  Your appreciations are helping me achieve a kind of portrait for me.  Thanks everyone.', '2005-03-23 00:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
