(1244863, 156227, 30173, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge ? I''m really disappointed from the dpchallenge members. Of course she''s the best friend of the photographer. It''s a beautiful picture and shows the best friend. I really don''t understand why all this children and animal pictures are higher rated than this here. It''s not difficult to make a photo of two cued kids or two ducks and name them "best friends". This here shows the real friendship between two people. Otherwise the photographer wouldn''t have had devoted the whole picture to "beautiful Anneu"</td>', 'Wrong challenge ? I''m really disappointed from the dpchallenge members. Of course she''s the best friend of the photographer. It''s a beautiful picture and shows the best friend. I really don''t understand why all this children and animal pictures are higher rated than this here. It''s not difficult to make a photo of two cued kids or two ducks and name them "best friends". This here shows the real friendship between two people. Otherwise the photographer wouldn''t have had devoted the whole picture to "beautiful Anneu"', '2005-03-23 07:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1244867, 156431, 34598, '<td valign="top">I would like to say. This one  actually deserves it. Awesome shot man.</td>', 'I would like to say. This one  actually deserves it. Awesome shot man.', '2005-03-23 07:32:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1244877, 154798, 30173, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge ? I''m really disappointed from the dpchallenge members. Of course he''s the best friend of the photographer. It''s a beautiful picture and shows the best friend. I really don''t understand why all this children and animal pictures are higher rated than this here. It''s not difficult to make a photo of two cued kids or two ducks and name them "best friends". This here shows the real friendship between two people. Otherwise the photographer wouldn''t have had devoted the whole picture to " Jok "  <br/>It''s a pity that people are not thinking a little bit further and try to see what''s behind a picture. Anyway, Sofap for me it''s the best picture of the challenge together with "Beautiful Anneu".</td>', 'Wrong challenge ? I''m really disappointed from the dpchallenge members. Of course he''s the best friend of the photographer. It''s a beautiful picture and shows the best friend. I really don''t understand why all this children and animal pictures are higher rated than this here. It''s not difficult to make a photo of two cued kids or two ducks and name them "best friends". This here shows the real friendship between two people. Otherwise the photographer wouldn''t have had devoted the whole picture to " Jok "  It''s a pity that people are not thinking a little bit further and try to see what''s behind a picture. Anyway, Sofap for me it''s the best picture of the challenge together with "Beautiful Anneu".', '2005-03-23 07:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1244891, 154943, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am consistently amazed that I can enter off focus semi- amusing bullshit crap like this and that someone actually finishes worse than this, and someone gave this a nine(9)! sorry if anyone thought this was serious- I just wanted to maybe make someone smile and say thats stuuupid!</td>', 'I am consistently amazed that I can enter off focus semi- amusing bullshit crap like this and that someone actually finishes worse than this, and someone gave this a nine(9)! sorry if anyone thought this was serious- I just wanted to maybe make someone smile and say thats stuuupid!', '2005-03-23 07:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
