(1245914, 156333, 7033, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10. I can''t believe it didn''t do higher. I noticed the really good duckling photo didn''t do as well as expected either so I''m thinking if it didn''t have people in it, people must have thought it didn''t fit the challenge very well. This was one of my favorites.</td>', 'I gave this a 10. I can''t believe it didn''t do higher. I noticed the really good duckling photo didn''t do as well as expected either so I''m thinking if it didn''t have people in it, people must have thought it didn''t fit the challenge very well. This was one of my favorites.', '2005-03-23 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
