(1251629, 156469, 18367, '<td valign="top">OK,,, I am intrigued... With the exception of the bryanbrazil who commented "Allright, what''s goin'' on? I saw these models once already!" you did not deem the other comments questioning the use of the same models as helpful... and I am wondering why.<br/> <br/>I personally think you should be proud of the fact that people studied your photograph enough to notice that, and I for one would have checked off that little box, just to acknowledge their effort.<br/> <br/>Could be that you viewed these comments as some form of slight???<br/> <br/>I don''t really expect any response to this question... but I am curious.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'OK,,, I am intrigued... With the exception of the bryanbrazil who commented "Allright, what''s goin'' on? I saw these models once already!" you did not deem the other comments questioning the use of the same models as helpful... and I am wondering why. I personally think you should be proud of the fact that people studied your photograph enough to notice that, and I for one would have checked off that little box, just to acknowledge their effort. Could be that you viewed these comments as some form of slight??? I don''t really expect any response to this question... but I am curious. Ray', '2005-03-26 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 0),
