(1282331, 156399, 34615, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your votes and comments. Its a pity that many people didn''t get it. Its a boxer with her boxing glove. When you''re boxing you have to trust yourself and your equipment. I really like thinking out of the box and being creative, but I hope you all get it next time :)</td>', 'Thanks for all your votes and comments. Its a pity that many people didn''t get it. Its a boxer with her boxing glove. When you''re boxing you have to trust yourself and your equipment. I really like thinking out of the box and being creative, but I hope you all get it next time :)', '2005-04-10 17:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1294573, 154798, 25655, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get to vote on this challenge unfortunately, but I think this one is a beautiful and strong portrait.<br/>He''s got to be your best friend or else you wouldn''t have put this photo up. <br/>This is the kind of photos that gives me that warm feeling inside.<br/>The man himself is very good looking, but your lighting and crop make his qualities to stand out so much more.</td>', 'Didn''t get to vote on this challenge unfortunately, but I think this one is a beautiful and strong portrait.He''s got to be your best friend or else you wouldn''t have put this photo up. This is the kind of photos that gives me that warm feeling inside.The man himself is very good looking, but your lighting and crop make his qualities to stand out so much more.', '2005-04-15 18:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1294675, 154798, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fantastic depth, light and technique - this is a truly rich and fulfilling portrait.<br/> <br/>I do agree that this doesn''t immediately communicate ''Best Friends'' but really, who cares? The challenges are there for competition but portfolios are what really count.<br/> <br/>My view is that if your challenge entry can''t communicate the theme at first glance (without a title) then it won''t fair too well with those who vote the theme element highly.<br/> <br/>Edit: I do find that border a bit overpowering though<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-15 18:09:06.</i></td>', 'Fantastic depth, light and technique - this is a truly rich and fulfilling portrait. I do agree that this doesn''t immediately communicate ''Best Friends'' but really, who cares? The challenges are there for competition but portfolios are what really count. My view is that if your challenge entry can''t communicate the theme at first glance (without a title) then it won''t fair too well with those who vote the theme element highly. Edit: I do find that border a bit overpowering though', '2005-04-15 19:08:30.000000', '2005-04-15 19:09:06.000000', 0),
(1294759, 154798, 93, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.. but I wish there was less border, and more photo.</td>', 'This is really cool.. but I wish there was less border, and more photo.', '2005-04-15 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1319592, 156143, 18080, '<td valign="top">Just checking out your profile and now i''m wondering why i only gave this shot a seven. It is so full of emotion. Really nice shot and should have placed higher.<br/> <br/>kev</td>', 'Just checking out your profile and now i''m wondering why i only gave this shot a seven. It is so full of emotion. Really nice shot and should have placed higher. kev', '2005-04-24 17:18:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1323673, 156399, 22781, '<td valign="top">Thinking out of the box is hier op DPC geen goed idee, tenminste, niet als je wilt scoren.<br/>Ik schrijf hier in het NL wat ik heb geleerd.<br/>Mocht je willen scoren moet je er voor zorgen dat onze vrienden aan de overkant van de oceaan de foto begrijpen.<br/>Ik wil niet zeggen dat ze daar niet zo slim zijn, maar het moet ze wel direct pakken.<br/>Je moet dus zorgen dat het "te duidelijk" is wat je met de foto wilt zeggen.<br/> <br/>Voldoe 100% aan de challenge, dat kan ontzettend saai zijn, maar denk vooral "inside the box" en probeer daar creatief te zijn.<br/>Als ze zeggen, vrienden, dan geen boxhandschoen, geen teddybeer, geen fotocamera.<br/> <br/>Verder zorg ervoor dat je foto behoorlijk "over gesatureerd" is. Sommigen zullen je ervoor haten, maar de meeste vinden veel kleur mooi.<br/> <br/>Hoop dat je er wat aan hebt.</td>', 'Thinking out of the box is hier op DPC geen goed idee, tenminste, niet als je wilt scoren.Ik schrijf hier in het NL wat ik heb geleerd.Mocht je willen scoren moet je er voor zorgen dat onze vrienden aan de overkant van de oceaan de foto begrijpen.Ik wil niet zeggen dat ze daar niet zo slim zijn, maar het moet ze wel direct pakken.Je moet dus zorgen dat het "te duidelijk" is wat je met de foto wilt zeggen. Voldoe 100% aan de challenge, dat kan ontzettend saai zijn, maar denk vooral "inside the box" en probeer daar creatief te zijn.Als ze zeggen, vrienden, dan geen boxhandschoen, geen teddybeer, geen fotocamera. Verder zorg ervoor dat je foto behoorlijk "over gesatureerd" is. Sommigen zullen je ervoor haten, maar de meeste vinden veel kleur mooi. Hoop dat je er wat aan hebt.', '2005-04-25 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
