(1399319, 156469, 33361, '<td valign="top">Ray - I just now saw your comment and will respond. Why I didn''t mark the comments regarding the use of the same models as helpful to me, is because they weren''t helpful to me. I knew we were the same models and to comment saying that, didn''t help me. The checkbox is for helpful comments. I don''t check the little box if the comment didn''t help me. It''s not a matter of being polite. <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-19 22:35:49.</i></td>', 'Ray - I just now saw your comment and will respond. Why I didn''t mark the comments regarding the use of the same models as helpful to me, is because they weren''t helpful to me. I knew we were the same models and to comment saying that, didn''t help me. The checkbox is for helpful comments. I don''t check the little box if the comment didn''t help me. It''s not a matter of being polite.  ', '2005-05-19 20:35:48.000000', '2005-05-19 23:35:49.000000', 0),
