(1411566, 155714, 34247, '<td valign="top">Hi Jeff,<br/>Like this image a lot. Might be interesting to do a crop adjustment and knock out the top third of the frame, creating a "landscape" look to it. Also, if you used neat image, I''m reckoning maybe a bit of a grainy look would be effective here. I like the lighting a lot, and the pockets of shadows in the snow works well.</td>', 'Hi Jeff,Like this image a lot. Might be interesting to do a crop adjustment and knock out the top third of the frame, creating a "landscape" look to it. Also, if you used neat image, I''m reckoning maybe a bit of a grainy look would be effective here. I like the lighting a lot, and the pockets of shadows in the snow works well.', '2005-05-25 13:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1434561, 154811, 35970, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this picture and how it captures innocent an boyhood in many ways. This trusting lad seems to have a bit of self-pride as well as a good friend. <br/> <br/>He''ll maybe never know that others in many countries around the world are sneaking a peak into his life. The colors and composition are light-hearted, yet his eyes seem have a bit of "seriousness" about music or having his photo taken. I wonder, did he break out laughing after the photo was taken?</td>', 'I love the mood of this picture and how it captures innocent an boyhood in many ways. This trusting lad seems to have a bit of self-pride as well as a good friend.  He''ll maybe never know that others in many countries around the world are sneaking a peak into his life. The colors and composition are light-hearted, yet his eyes seem have a bit of "seriousness" about music or having his photo taken. I wonder, did he break out laughing after the photo was taken?', '2005-06-05 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1453339, 156534, 34659, '<td valign="top">Exquisite lighting in this shot...  I love the composition and crop.  The warm feel of the image really comes across - nice job!  It makes me think that I can almost smell the fresh baby...  Superb work.</td>', 'Exquisite lighting in this shot...  I love the composition and crop.  The warm feel of the image really comes across - nice job!  It makes me think that I can almost smell the fresh baby...  Superb work.', '2005-06-13 22:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
