(1454659, 156534, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo. Wish you could have captured the glow on the baby''s face,eliminated the Pooh figure. Then you could zoom in on that adorable sleeping face.</td>', 'Sweet photo. Wish you could have captured the glow on the baby''s face,eliminated the Pooh figure. Then you could zoom in on that adorable sleeping face.', '2005-06-14 12:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
