(1481851, 156154, 16488, '<td valign="top">Challenge victim?  With so few comments it''s hard to tell.  (I didn''t enter or vote in this one.)<br/> <br/>The problematic parts for me are: highlights blown out = loss of detail in the blouse, nose ring evidently missing, sub-par background detracting.  (I know, you didn''t ask.)<br/> <br/>What makes it worthy (for me) are: the facial expression, the point of view, the detail in the hair, the unaffected casualness of it all.  It''s as if you captured a beautiful candid, while setting it up all the time.<br/> <br/>Thanks for "playing" today in the "closest to 5" thread.</td>', 'Challenge victim?  With so few comments it''s hard to tell.  (I didn''t enter or vote in this one.) The problematic parts for me are: highlights blown out = loss of detail in the blouse, nose ring evidently missing, sub-par background detracting.  (I know, you didn''t ask.) What makes it worthy (for me) are: the facial expression, the point of view, the detail in the hair, the unaffected casualness of it all.  It''s as if you captured a beautiful candid, while setting it up all the time. Thanks for "playing" today in the "closest to 5" thread.', '2005-06-24 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
