(1856881, 154817, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  How on earth did you ever get all of them to sit and stay like that!  And for the larger dog to sit with the treats and all the headgear, WONDERFUL!<br/> <br/>The only thing I noticed, it''s a pet (pun intended) peeve is it seems a bit crooked, leaning to the left a bit if you will, maybe  just the slightest rotation to the right and a bump in the contrast and this shot would be perfect for me!  I love animal shots, made it one of my favs!<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I love this shot!  How on earth did you ever get all of them to sit and stay like that!  And for the larger dog to sit with the treats and all the headgear, WONDERFUL! The only thing I noticed, it''s a pet (pun intended) peeve is it seems a bit crooked, leaning to the left a bit if you will, maybe  just the slightest rotation to the right and a bump in the contrast and this shot would be perfect for me!  I love animal shots, made it one of my favs! Keep up the good work!', '2005-11-10 22:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
