(1860120, 154817, 24500, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neuferland:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this shot!  How on earth did you ever get all of them to sit and stay like that!  And for the larger dog to sit with the treats and all the headgear, WONDERFUL!<br/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These very well trained talented street performers are part of the landscape here in Ottawa and are much more enjoyable than our usual tourist attractions.  Meeting them is like being on the set of a movie.  They leave you wanting to take their autographs.<br/> <br/>by Donald</td>', 'Originally posted by Neuferland: I love this shot!  How on earth did you ever get all of them to sit and stay like that!  And for the larger dog to sit with the treats and all the headgear, WONDERFUL!   These very well trained talented street performers are part of the landscape here in Ottawa and are much more enjoyable than our usual tourist attractions.  Meeting them is like being on the set of a movie.  They leave you wanting to take their autographs. by Donald', '2005-11-12 09:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
