(2576179, 155525, 50466, '<td valign="top">The dog''s expression is perfect. I do not like the grainy shadow in the bottom right corner however. I think this image would be much better if you cloned out the shadow, added some sharpening, and did a curves adjusment. Here is my attempt at it...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=357302" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50466/thumb/357302.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50466/thumb/357302.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50466/thumb/357302.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>edit: I didn''t notice at first that this was a Basic Editing challenge. In that case you could have got a lamp and shined it in the direction of the shadow on the wall, or used a reflector to try to eliminate it. <br/> <br/>ps: I hope this helps. If you are not ok with me editing your picture just let me know and I will take it down immediately. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-02 23:43:32.</i></td>', 'The dog''s expression is perfect. I do not like the grainy shadow in the bottom right corner however. I think this image would be much better if you cloned out the shadow, added some sharpening, and did a curves adjusment. Here is my attempt at it...   edit: I didn''t notice at first that this was a Basic Editing challenge. In that case you could have got a lamp and shined it in the direction of the shadow on the wall, or used a reflector to try to eliminate it.  ps: I hope this helps. If you are not ok with me editing your picture just let me know and I will take it down immediately. ', '2006-07-03 00:39:06.000000', '2006-07-03 00:43:32.000000', 0),
